00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:37.890
Te ni tsukanda hikari wo

00:23:37.890 --> 00:24:08.140
Next Episode

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:41.700
Ha...

00:23:41.990 --> 00:23:43.660
What? Yuno did?

00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:48.030
She only ate one plate of curry. In the morning,
she only had enough time for one slice of toast.

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:49.240
That's pretty normal.

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:54.540
Does she have lovesickness?
She's growing so fast!

00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:58.210
What? What did I do wrong?

00:23:58.880 --> 00:24:02.840
Next Episode is ''September 4th: The Wolf
of the Shinjuku Backstreets''

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:07.230
We'll be waiting at Yamabuki High,
so please, join us again.
